<title>CANADA: Ault names new chairman, two directors.</title>
<headline>Ault names new chairman, two directors.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ault Foods Ltd said on Thursday that it has appointed a new chairman and two new directors to the company's board.</p>
<p>Norman Currie has been named chairman of the board, replacing Don Loadman who resigned to pursue personal interests, Ault said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company also appointed Germaine Gibara and Jack Scott to its board of directors.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
